And when we re-parse `/:foo Tigers`:
- `:foo` → param named "foo" (space is not ID_Continue, so "foo" stops before the space)
- ` Tigers` → text

So the round-trip works fine. My test was wrong. The issue is specifically about when the next text starts with an astral character that is ID_Continue - the `.value[0]` approach fails to detect it for astral characters.

